31:51.750 --> 31:52.850
Awak tunggulah.

31:53.140 --> 31:56.000
Nanti dia datang sembang
dengan awak malam-malam.

32:01.750 --> 32:02.620
Kuat berlakon.

32:11.850 --> 32:14.280
Mak cik kena tengok betul-betul

32:14.300 --> 32:15.560
