33:49.260 --> 33:50.490
Penatnya saya.

33:51.110 --> 33:52.150
Li Yifei.

33:52.820 --> 33:54.450
Awak tak pergi ke pasar?

33:54.610 --> 33:56.070
Awak beli di pasar raya import?

33:56.070 --> 33:57.200
Sangat mahal, tahu?

33:59.330 --> 33:59.930
Sudahlah.

33:59.950 --> 34:01.210
Orang yang IQ rendah macam awak ini,

34:01.210 --> 34:02.810
